<title>POLAND: Elektromontaz-W 96 net up at PLN 1.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Elektromontaz-W 96 net up at PLN 1.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary Elektromontaz - Warszawa SA results for year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>    JANUARY-DECEMBER			 1996	  1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			 3.15 vs     2.22</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   3.30 vs     2.31</p>
<p>    net profit				 1.84 vs     1.36</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Elektromontaz-Warszawa SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 51.58 vs   42.36</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  50.46 vs   41.57</p>
<p>    extraordinary		loss	0.03 vs    0.01 profit</p>
<p>    income tax				 1.46 vs    0.95</p>
<p>    other taxes				 na  vs     na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.25 vs    0.17</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.08 vs    0.02</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
